## P×I Scoring

### Probability (1–4)

| Score | Label           | Criteria                                        |
| ----- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| 1     | Unlikely        | Rare; requires exceptional circumstances        |
| 2     | Possible        | Could occur; has happened in similar contexts   |
| 3     | Likely          | Expected to occur at some point                 |
| 4     | Almost Certain  | Will occur; seen frequently in this domain      |

**Selected Probability:** \_\_ / Rationale: _..._

### Impact (1–4)

| Score | Label    | Criteria                                                         |
| ----- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1     | Low      | Minimal disruption; no data exposure; quickly recoverable        |
| 2     | Medium   | Partial service disruption; limited data exposure                |
| 3     | High     | Significant outage; potential regulatory impact or data breach   |
| 4     | Critical | Full service down; major data breach; legal / reputational damage |

**Selected Impact:** \_\_ / Rationale: _..._

### Score

**Score = Probability × Impact = \_\_ × \_\_ = \_\_**

| Score | Tier     | Response SLA                                  |
| ----- | -------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| ≤ 4   | Low      | Monitor; review at next quarterly cycle       |
| 5–8   | Medium   | Mitigate within 90 days; add to backlog       |
| 9–12  | High     | Mitigate within 30 days; notify security lead |
| > 12  | Critical | Immediate action; escalate to management      |

**Tier:** \_\_

