## Mitigation

### Treatment option

- [ ] **Mitigate** — implement controls to reduce probability or impact
- [ ] **Accept** — formally accept residual risk (document business justification)
- [ ] **Transfer** — shift risk to third party (insurance, contract)
- [ ] **Avoid** — change design or process to eliminate the risk

